trait-unholy-name = Unholy
trait-unholy-desc =
  Whether being smote by the gods or simply being a sinner, you are unholy.
  All that is holy will be harmful to you. If you are a chaplain, you cannot pray.

trait-holy-name = Holy
trait-holy-desc =
  Coming from a heavily religious background, you have entrusted your life to the Gods.
  You can pray just like a chaplain would, but you don't have any of their gear.
